   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Objectives"
   m_sTextData "Defend both bombsites."\
   ""\
   "The enemy can come from the West or North, prepare your defenses accordingly."\
   ""\
   "To use the javelins treat them like stingers, aim down sights, put target on crosshair, hold left control (default keybind), wait for tone, then fire."\
   ""\
   "The Javelins also have a known bug where they won't lock on to anythings just swap to your primary weapon and swap back to the Javelin and aim down sights, do this until you see it say Top Attack near your Javelin's ammo count and you are ready to lock on."\
   ""
